{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09653","headline":"早上五盘岭 · 岑参","name":"早上五盘岭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平旦驱驷马，旷然出五盘。\n江回两崖鬬，日隐羣峰攒。\n苍翠烟景曙，森沈云树寒。\n松疎露孤驿，花密藏回滩。\n栈道谿雨滑，畲田原草乾。\n此行爲知己，不觉蜀道难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}